  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000qazs](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000qazs) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Jul 06 2025 27km SE of Santa Maria De Cahuapanas. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -5.4814 longitude -76.9633. It impacted 26949 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
